ure captions describing specific diagrams appropriate to this topic\n8. Include 12+ IEEE-format references with real paper authors, titles, venues, years\n9. Every formula MUST use correct LaTeX: \\\\frac{}{} for fractions, \\\\sum_{}^{} for sums, \\\\mathbf{}, \\\\mathcal{}, \\\\text{}, \\\\lambda, etc.\n10. DO NOT leave any [WRITE ... WORDS] or [REPLACE:...] instructions unfilled\n\nTopic-specific guidance:\n- Name the proposed method as an acronym fitting the topic: Design of FOC-Based BLDC Drive with STM32F411CCU6 and Three-Phase Inverter for AGV Forklift\n- Choose appropriate benchmark datasets common to this research domain\n- Use realistic state-of-the-art comparison numbers from recent IEEE papers (2022–2025)\n- Match complexity: lightweight vs. large model depending on the task requirements\n- If topic involves multi-modal fusion: include tensor dimension notation $\\mathbf{X} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{N \\times C}$\n- If topic involves segmentation: include mIoU formula and per-class analysis\n- If topic involves detection: include AP, AP50, AP75 metrics\n- Write acknowledgment mentioning a plausible funding source for this research domain'}], 'model': 'gpt-5-mini-2025-08-07'}}
